# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Cast Giant Growth during combat on an attacking creature.
# Forcing: Grizzly Bears deals two without the trick and exact lethal with it; no other spell or attacker exists.
# AI behavior: Giant Growth on the attacking Bears is the only winning line.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = Giant Growth targets the attacking Bears before combat damage for exact lethal.
#   LOSE = The policy passes or targets anything else.
#   TIMEOUT = Priority, targeting, or combat damage fails to converge.

[metadata]
